    <briefdescription>
<para>Per-pin configuration for GPIO-triggered interrupt configuration. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Cached by XPm_GpioProcHandlerInit(). The shared XPm_GpioProcHandler() iterates the global <ref refid="struct_x_pm___gpio_proc_cfg" kindref="compound">XPm_GpioProcCfg</ref>[] array, checks each pin&apos;s INT_STAT to identify which pin triggered, and executes the correct CDO PROC. </para>    </detaileddescription>
